---
// ServicesSection.astro — Complete Creative Services Breakdown
// Light theme with purple tint & gold accents
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#faf8ff] bg-subtle-grid border-b border-purple-200/60" id="services">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-900 bg-purple-100 border border-purple-200 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3 font-display shadow-sm">
        <span class="inline-block text-amber-500 animate-spin-slow">✦</span>
        <span>Full Studio Capabilities</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#180f2d] tracking-tight mb-4 font-display leading-tight">
        Every Creative & Digital Service <span class="text-gradient-purple-gold">Under One Roof</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#4e4368] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-sans">
        We handle everything from your web code to your camera reels. No need to manage 4 different freelance vendors — our 3-founder studio does it all in-house.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Services Grid (6 Core Offerings) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Service 1: Digital Marketing & Meta Ads -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            🚀
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-200">
            Performance Ads
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            Digital Marketing & Meta Paid Ads
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            We build and run profitable ad campaigns on Instagram and Facebook. Laser-targeted audience research, persuasive ad copywriting, retargeting pixels, and lead generation funnels.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Meta (FB/IG) Ad Campaign Setup
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> A/B Split Testing & Audience Research
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Inbound WhatsApp Lead Automation
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Weekly Transparent Performance Reviews
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-purple-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Meta Ads</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 2: Custom Web Development -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            💻
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-purple-200">
            Web Architecture
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            Custom High-Speed Web Development
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            We don't use sluggish WordPress themes stuffed with 50 plugins. We write clean, ultra-fast custom code that loads in under 1 second, looks stunning on phones, and converts visitors into paying inquiries.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> 100/100 Core Web Vitals Speed Score
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Mobile-First Responsive Design
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Direct WhatsApp & Phone Action Buttons
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Custom Domain, SSL & Cloud Hosting
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-amber-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Websites</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 3: 4K Commercial Video & Viral Reels -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            🎬
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-200">
            Video Production
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            4K Video Production & Reels
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            Directed and filmed by Naveen. We create commercial brand videos, product shoots, and viral Instagram reels with hook-first pacing, cinematic lighting, and custom color grading.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> 4K On-Location Shoot & Cinematography
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Short-Form Viral Reel Editing (9:16)
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Sound Design & Trending Audio Sync
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Professional Color Grading & Titles
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-purple-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Video Production</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 4: Graphic Design & Posters -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            🎨
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-purple-200">
            Visual Creatives
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            Poster Design & Graphic Art
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            Crafted by Nidhith. Striking promotional posters, event flyers, cafe menu layouts, product social creatives, and banners that command attention instantly on social media and in print.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Commercial Launch & Event Posters
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> High-Res Print-Ready & Digital Formats
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Instagram Feed Creatives & Carousels
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Menu Design & Retail Standee Graphics
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-amber-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Posters & Graphics</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 5: Search Engine Optimization (SEO) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            🔍
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-200">
            Organic Traffic
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            Search Engine Optimization (SEO)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            Dominate local Mysuru search results and regional Google searches. We optimize your Google Business profile, write keyword-rich metadata, and build technical speed that Google loves.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Google Map Pack & Local Citations
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> On-Page SEO & Schema Rich Snippets
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Keyword Targeting for High-Intent Searches
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">✓</span> Google Search Console Setup & Indexing
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-purple-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for SEO</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 6: Brand Identity & Social Direction -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/80 shadow-sm hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            📱
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-purple-200">
            Brand Identity
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1c1335] font-display mt-3 mb-2">
            Social Media & Brand Identity
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5e5377] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            Give your business a distinct, memorable personality. Complete brand identity systems including modern logo vectors, color palettes, typography guidelines, and content curation.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Deliverables:</span>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Logo Design & Vector Identity Assets
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Brand Color Guidelines & Typography
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Instagram Grid Aesthetic Direction
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">✓</span> Social Media Bio & Linktree Optimization
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-purple-100">
          <a 
            href="#quote-card" 
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-bold text-xs font-display flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors border border-amber-200"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Brand Identity</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
